{"seq":3,"slug":"principles","title":"原理：三件放大稀有事件的工具","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/large-deviations-theory/principles","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sanov-theorem","title":"Sanov 定理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/large-deviations-theory/principles/sanov-theorem","wordCount":1611,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"gartner-ellis","title":"Gärtner-Ellis 定理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/large-deviations-theory/principles/gartner-ellis","wordCount":1600,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"contraction-principle","title":"收缩原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/large-deviations-theory/principles/contraction-principle","wordCount":1604,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"原理-三件放大稀有事件的工具\">原理：三件放大稀有事件的工具</h1><p>Cramér 定理漂亮，却有两条硬约束：它只管独立同分布的标量之和，且要求矩母函数处处有限。现实里的稀有事件远比这复杂——我们想知道整个经验分布偏离真实分布的概率、想处理马氏链这类相依序列、想把已知一个量的大偏差率转移到它的函数上。本章的三大定理，正是逐一拆掉这些约束的工具箱。</p>\n<p><a href=\"sanov-theorem\">Sanov 定理</a> 把研究对象从&quot;和&quot;升级到&quot;经验分布&quot;：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个样本的经验测度偏离真实分布 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 到某个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 的概率率函数，恰是相对熵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D(Q\\|P)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这一步把大偏差与信息论焊在一起。<a href=\"gartner-ellis\">Gärtner-Ellis 定理</a> 松绑独立同分布假设：只要缩放对数矩母函数有良好极限且陡峭，LDP 就成立，率函数仍是那个 Legendre 变换——马氏链、相依序列由此纳入统一框架。<a href=\"contraction-principle\">收缩原理</a> 提供传递机制：若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 满足率函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span> 的 LDP，则连续映射后的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(X_n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 也满足 LDP，新率函数由变分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>inf</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\inf\\{I(x): f(x)=y\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">in<span style=\"margin-right:0.0778em;\">f</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span> 给出——这是从一个已知 LDP 批量生产新 LDP 的引擎。</p>\n<p>三篇的逻辑关系是&quot;两个源头 + 一个传递器&quot;：Sanov 与 Gärtner-Ellis 各自从头建立 LDP（一个针对经验分布、一个针对相依和），收缩原理则把这些 LDP 沿映射网络扩散到无数派生量上。掌握本章后，读者面对陌生的大偏差问题，通常的策略就是：能否用 Gärtner-Ellis 直接算，或先在 Sanov 层面建立 LDP 再用收缩原理压到目标量。第四章的应用几乎全靠这套策略驱动。</p>\n"}